  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operations and Maintenance/Administrative Costs; The FACTS Program is responsible for the development and management of information systems to support foreign assistance budgeting and performance reporting processes. The Foreign Assistance Coordination and Tracking System (FACTS) Info is the system that currently facilitates budget planning, formulation, and allocation at the country, regional and HQ levels to ensure that foreign assistance program funds are in alignment with U.S. foreign policy objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
